<title>POLAND: Kety trades off-the-floor at PLN 195.</title>
<headline>Kety trades off-the-floor at PLN 195.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>An off-the-floor transaction in 18,500 shares in Kety SA, priced at 195 zlotys, was struck at the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Kety rose to 195 zlotys in 10,940 share volume. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
